# Combined strategy executor crontab — /etc/cron.d/20dxsmomportfolio
# Canonical source: jahrfm/20dXSMomPortfolio deploy/cron/combined.crontab
# Installed by deploy/update_vps.sh (repo = source of truth).
#
# Timezone-independent by design: the executor itself decides what to do from
# UTC dates and its state file. Each hourly run reconciles positions and
# trails/re-asserts stops; the FIRST run after Hermes pushes
# combined_signals_<yesterday UTC>.json (~00:05 UTC) also places entries.
# Later runs for the same signal are manage-only.
#
# Paper mode (no orders, simulated account on mainnet prices) until
# COMBINED_AUTO_TRADE=true in /root/.hermes/.env.

# --- self-update: pull code + data repos, install this crontab (every 15 min) ---
*/15 * * * * root /opt/20dxsmomportfolio/update_vps.sh >> /opt/20dxsmomportfolio/update.log 2>&1

# --- executor: hourly at :20 (after the :15 self-update has pulled signals) ---
20 * * * * root cd /opt/20dxsmomportfolio && python3 scripts/run_combined_execution.py >> /opt/20dxsmomportfolio/logs/combined_execution.log 2>&1
